  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 22 × 11 + 13 − 12 ÷ 2 = ?\n\nAfter '+' and ‘-' are interchanged and '×' and ‘÷' are interchanged then,\n\n22 × 11 + 13 − 12 ÷ 2 = ? ⇒ 22 ÷ 11 - 13 + 12 × 2 = ?\n\n⇒ __**22 ÷**____** 11**__ - 13 + 12 × 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 2 - 13 + __**12 **____**×**____** 2**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**2**____** + 24**__ - 13 = ?\n\n⇒ 26 - 13 = ?\n\n⇒ 13 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
